data: {"id": "f813391ae8944334-thinking-parallel_evidence-2162", "run_id": "f813391ae8944334", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好，以下是根据第一轮可观测性 baseline（Prometheus、Logging、Tracing）得出的阶段性事实，以及对后续补证计划的说明。\n\n## 1. 已确认事实（来自首轮 baseline）\n\n### 1.1 Kubernetes 生命周期与重启（Prometheus）\n- **Pod UID**: `f2db1889-e2c8-4073-b40b-7603dc0755f7`，节点 `node2`，Pod IP `172.16.104.32`，容器 `app`。\n- **重启次数**: `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total = 7`。Pod 已重启 7 次。\n- **上次终止原因**: `kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason = 1`，`reason=\"Error\"`。**未出现 `OOMKilled`**。\n\n### 1.2 日志（Elasticsearch/Filebeat）\n- 近 30 分钟（2026-09-07 20:55 ~ 21:05 UTC）的日志全部为", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788815141108, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

